paperweight-plymouth (0.1.5-1) trixie; urgency=high

  * Fix black screen: replace Plymouth.GetTime() and ternary operators with
    proven constructs. Plymouth.GetTime() is not available in all versions;
    ternary (?:) is absent from reference themes. Now uses a tick/step frame
    counter (50 ticks = ~1 second at Plymouth's 50 Hz refresh rate) and
    if/else for rock opacity, matching the pattern of upstream Plymouth themes.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Tue, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:03 +0000

paperweight-plymouth (0.1.4-1) trixie; urgency=high

  * Fix black screen: replace Sprite.GetY() calls with local variables.
    Plymouth's scripting API does not expose GetY() on sprites; calling it
    returns undefined, crashing the refresh callback before anything renders.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Tue, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:02 +0000

paperweight-plymouth (0.1.3-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Replace text-only animation with logo+rock splash: display logo.png
    (color_logo.svg at 256x256), "PaperweightOS" label, and five rock
    indicators that fill left-to-right one per second (0-5-0 cycle).
